stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> committed: canonical root issuance and matching receipt in one Ticket transaction
    committed --> committed: live flow or OIDC authorization; source credential remains; missing terminal audit; retention delay; hold
    committed --> deleted: all continuation deadlines plus explicit proof retention passed; Source credential absent; consumed and purged Chronicle facts match; no hold; Source Client then OIDC then flow then receipt locks
    deleted --> [*]: established root token remains
